            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "考点3: 卷积的代数性质(LTIS系统下可用)"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.139,
                0.275,
                0.154
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1、交换律"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.385,
                0.163,
                0.61,
                0.18
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nf _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (t) = f _ {2} (t) * f _ {1} (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.186,
                0.364,
                0.201
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2、结合律与系统结构"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.318,
                0.209,
                0.679,
                0.227
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n[ f _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (t) ] * f _ {3} (t) = f _ {1} (t) * [ f _ {2} (t) * f _ {3} (t) ]\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.232,
                0.81,
                0.272
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "结合律用于系统分析，相当于串联系统的冲激响应，等于组成串联系统的各子系统冲激响应的卷积，如图所示。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "bbox": [
                0.245,
                0.286,
                0.743,
                0.347
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.365,
                0.36,
                0.592,
                0.377
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "串联系统的 \\( h(t)=h_{1}(t)*h_{2}(t) \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.406,
                0.364,
                0.422
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3、分配律与系统结构"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.291,
                0.43,
                0.705,
                0.448
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nf _ {1} (t) * \\left[ f _ {2} (t) + f _ {3} (t) \\right] = f _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (t) + f _ {1} (t) * f _ {3} (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.454,
                0.809,
                0.494
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "分配律用于系统分析，相当于并联系统的冲激响应，等于组成并联系统的各子系统冲激响应之和，如图所示。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "bbox": [
                0.208,
                0.501,
                0.792,
                0.635
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "image_caption",
            "bbox": [
                0.312,
                0.653,
                0.572,
                0.67
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "并联系统的 \\(h(t) = h_{1}(t) + h_{2}(t)\\)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.193,
                0.679,
                0.293,
                0.695
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "【混连结构】",
