                0.164,
                0.747,
                0.182
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例36：设 \\(f_{1}(t) = 3e^{-2t}u(t)\\) ， \\(f_{2}(t) = 2u(t)\\) ，求卷积积分 \\(f_{1}(t)*f_{2}(t)\\) 。",
            "merge_prev": false
