                0.322,
                0.811,
                0.364
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例 37: 已知某线性时不变系统的冲激响应 \\(h(t) = u(t - 1)\\), 利用卷积求系统对输入 \\(f(t) = e^{-3t}u(t)\\) 的零状态响应 \\(y(t)\\)。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.349,
                0.529,
                0.647,
                0.546
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nf _ {1} (t) = t u (t), f _ {2} (t) = u (t) - u (t - 2)\n\\]"
