            "content": "考点5：卷积求解：图解法——借助于信号相乘运算"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.139,
                0.4,
                0.154
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1、原理：两个信号的相乘",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.163,
                0.257,
                0.178
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2、步骤",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.187,
                0.307,
                0.204
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(1)更换自变量",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.385,
                0.212,
                0.61,
                0.229
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nf _ {1} (t) \\rightarrow f _ {1} (\\tau), f _ {2} (t) \\rightarrow f _ {2} (\\tau)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.234,
                0.29,
                0.25
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2)反转移位",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.379,
                0.26,
                0.617,
                0.284
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nf _ {2} (\\tau) \\stackrel {\\text {反转}} {\\longrightarrow} f _ {2} (- \\tau) \\stackrel {\\text {移项}} {\\longrightarrow} f _ {2} (t - \\tau)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.29,
                0.469,
                0.306
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(3)相乘，只关注时域有相交的情况",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.434,
                0.314,
                0.563,
                0.331
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nf _ {1} (\\tau) \\cdot f _ {2} (t - \\tau)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.336,
                0.397,
                0.352
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(4)每种相交情况下的积分",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.405,
                0.36,
                0.589,
                0.395
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (\\tau) \\cdot f _ {2} (t - \\tau) d \\tau\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.425,
                0.529,
